@startuml
title Timing <latex>\plugh</latex>
robust "<latex>\foo</latex> in" as A
concise "Out <latex>\bark</latex>" as B
A has "<latex>\baz</latex>" as hi, "Lo" as lo

@0
A is hi
B is "<latex>\qux</latex>"
A is lo : <latex>\quux</latex> start

@50
A is hi
B is Idle
A@50 -> B@+10 : <latex>\corge</latex> sent
A@0 <-> @50 : {<latex>\grault</latex>}
@0 <-> @50 : {<latex>\garply</latex>}
highlight 0 to 50 #Gold : <latex>\waldo</latex> span
note top of A : above <latex>\fred</latex>
@enduml
